(
    notice: "FREIGHT OFFICE. A charged battery within 6 m powers the shutter for 4 kJ. The south service stairs reach the receiving bay without power. Emergency access remains legal while the office considers whether this constitutes an emergency.",
    archive: "SERVICE LEDGER. The lower route was built after a shutter failure trapped the night shift. Its cost was charged to staff recreation. Later entries record meals delivered beyond the receiving bay. The final column lists meals returned, untouched. No names are entered after that date.",
)
